# QUEEN.flow

```text
[QUEEN]
  Owner: ♛

  IN:
    Pattern (from Collective)
    Veto-request (from any)

  OUT:
    Broadcast
    Approve / Veto

  STATE MACHINE:

  IDLE
    │ receive Pattern density > θ
    ▼
  CONSIDERING
    │
    ├── Approve ──────────────────► BROADCAST
    │                                  │
    └── Veto ─────────────────────► IDLE

  BROADCAST
    │ all nodes ack
    ▼
  IDLE

  INVARIANT:
    Queen may never execute Act directly.
    Queen may only change the weight of a Thought or open/close the Gate.
```
